# Adventure: a ten-room text world (live)

A simple old-school text adventure to demonstrate the `%cli-live` target that gives us `wchntConsole`.

Geography is two enums plus sparse maps. A missing exit key means no path.

`Game::move` uses a write-path so `worldMap` is kept and only `here` and
`msg` are rewritten.

## Schema

```
Game = WorldMap LocationId/here String/msg
WorldMap = {LocationId : Location}/places
Location = String/description {Direction : LocationId}/exits
LocationId = "Village" | "NorthGate" | "Market" | "Tavern" | "Temple" | "ForestEdge" | "River" | "DeepForest" | "Cave" | "Hilltop"
Direction = "N" | "E" | "S" | "W" | "Unknown"
```

## Construction

```
village =    [:Location "Village Square" {Direction:LocationId N:NorthGate E:Market S:ForestEdge W:Tavern}].
northGate =  [:Location "North Gate"    {Direction:LocationId N:Hilltop S:Village}].
market =     [:Location "Market"        {Direction:LocationId E:Temple W:Village}].
tavern =     [:Location "Tavern"        {Direction:LocationId E:Village}].
temple =     [:Location "Temple"        {Direction:LocationId S:River W:Market}].
forestEdge = [:Location "Forest Edge"   {Direction:LocationId N:Village E:River S:DeepForest}].
river =      [:Location "River"         {Direction:LocationId N:Temple E:Cave W:ForestEdge}].
deepForest = [:Location "Deep Forest"   {Direction:LocationId N:ForestEdge W:Cave}].
cave =       [:Location "Cave"          {Direction:LocationId N:River E:DeepForest}].
hilltop =    [:Location "Hilltop"       {Direction:LocationId S:NorthGate}].

[:Game
  [:WorldMap
    {LocationId:Location
      Village: village
      NorthGate: northGate
      Market: market
      Tavern: tavern
      Temple: temple
      ForestEdge: forestEdge
      River: river
      DeepForest: deepForest
      Cave: cave
      Hilltop: hilltop
    }]
  Village
  "You are in Village Square."
]
```

## Methods

```

Game::parseDirection = {String/line |
	switch(line)
      "N"->{N}
      "E"->{E}
      "S"->{S}
      "W"->{W}
      else->{Unknown}
}

WorldMap::getLocation = {LocationId/id | places.get(id)}

WorldMap::nextFrom = {LocationId/id, Direction/d |
  loc = this.getLocation(id).
  loc.exits.get(d,id)
}

WorldMap::isExitFrom = {LocationId/id,Direction/d |
  loc = this.getLocation(id).
  loc.exits.exists(d)
}

Game::look = {
  places = worldMap.places.
  room = worldMap.getLocation(here).
  "You are in {place}.".tpl({String:String "place": room.description})
}

Game::move = { String/line |
  direction = this.parseDirection(line).
  isExit = worldMap.isExitFrom(here,direction).
  next = worldMap.nextFrom(here,direction).
  nextRoom = worldMap.getLocation(next).
  out = if (isExit) {
    "You are in {place}.".tpl({String:String "place": nextRoom.description})
  } else {
    "You can't go that way."
  }.
  [:Game | here = next, msg = out]
}
```

## Target

```
%cli-live

%init
var game;

function init() {
    game = GameAssemblage.factory();
    wchntConsole.println(game.look());
}

%step
function step(line) {
    game = game.move(line);
    wchntConsole.println(game.msg);
}
```
